Energistics Transfer Protocol (ETP) v1.2 schemas
------------------------------------------------
The Avro schemas under rc/etp-1.2/ and the Rust types generated from them
(crates/generated/) derive from the Energistics Transfer Protocol (ETP) v1.2
Avro schemas published by Energistics:

    https://bitbucket.org/energistics/etpv1

Those schemas are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright Energistics Consortium, Inc.

They are the 212 .avsc files of etpv1@f94c3f9e96df005eb90600eec0ac7a3541597b3b
(tag v1.2), byte for byte; rc/etp-1.2/PROVENANCE.md records the archive, its
SHA-256 and a digest of the tree.

